 Functional Requirements
   
User registration with personal details
Anonymous user access option
Data input and submission handling
Validation of user input
Store data in database
Display success or error messages
   
🔹 Non-Functional Requirements
   
System should be secure
Data should be stored safely
Fast response time for user actions
Easy and simple user interface
System should handle multiple users
   
🔹 Hardware Requirements
   
Any computer or laptop
Minimum 4GB RAM
Stable internet connection 
   
🔹 Software Requirements
   
Operating System: Windows / Linux
Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript (conceptual for now)
Backend: Node.js / Python (future use)
Database: SQLite / MySQL / MongoDB
Code Editor: VS Code
